  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together eggs, velvety sauce, jazzy seasoning, salt, and pepper.",
    "3. Add chopped russian dill to the egg mixture and stir well.",
    "4. Pour the egg mixture into a greased 9-inch pie plate.",
    "5. Bake for 25-30 minutes or until the edges are golden brown and the center is set.",
    "6. Remove from oven and let cool for a few minutes.",
    "7. Slice the frittata into wedges and serve hot."
